<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en-AU">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"/>
<meta content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" name="viewport"/>
<title>BuySooner — Linked Prototype</title>
<style>
    :root {
      --navy: #071f3a;
      --teal: #087a78;
      --teal-dark: #056261;
      --pale-teal: #eaf6f5;
      --border: #d7e5e4;
      --text: #1f2933;
      --muted: #64748b;
      --error: #b42318;
      --error-bg: #fff4f2;
      --white: #ffffff;
      --gold: #d99a22;
      --gold-soft: #fff5df;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      color: var(--text);
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(8, 122, 120, 0.10), transparent 32%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0%, #f7fbfb 48%, #eef8f7 100%);
    }
    .page { min-height: 100vh; display: flex; justify-content: center; padding: 32px 20px 44px; }
    .shell { width: 100%; max-width: 1280px; }
    .screen { display: none; }
    .screen.active { display: block; }
    .brand { display: block; margin-bottom: 22px; }
    .brand-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; align-items: flex-end; margin-bottom: 22px; }
    .brand h1, .brand-block h1 { margin: 0; color: var(--navy); font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size: 42px; letter-spacing: -0.04em; line-height: 0.95; }
    .brand-line { width: 54px; height: 4px; background: var(--teal); border-radius: 999px; margin: 12px 0 10px; }
    .brand p, .brand-block p { margin: 0; color: var(--teal); font-size: 15px; font-weight: 800; }
    .progress { min-width: 270px; text-align: right; }
    .progress-label { color: var(--navy); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 900; margin-bottom: 9px; }
    .progress-track { width: 100%; height: 7px; background: #dbe9e8; border-radius: 999px; overflow: hidden; }
    .progress-bar { height: 100%; background: var(--teal); border-radius: 999px; }
    .card { background: var(--white); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 28px; box-shadow: 0 22px 70px rgba(7, 31, 58, 0.10); overflow: hidden; }
    .hero { padding: 38px 44px 28px; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0%, #f3fbfa 100%); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
    .hero h2 { margin: 0 0 12px; color: var(--navy); font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size: 42px; letter-spacing: -0.035em; line-height: 1.05; max-width: 930px; }
    .hero .promise { margin: 0 0 28px; max-width: 860px; color: var(--teal); font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.5; font-weight: 900; }
    .check-title { margin: 0 0 10px; color: var(--navy); font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size: 31px; letter-spacing: -0.025em; line-height: 1.1; }
    .check-copy { margin: 0; max-width: 890px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; font-weight: 700; }
    .form-area, .content { padding: 30px 44px 36px; }
    .fact-title { margin: 0 0 18px; color: var(--teal); font-size: 20px; font-weight: 900; line-height: 1.35; text-align: center; }
    .fact-strip { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 0; margin: 0 0 30px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 20px; overflow: hidden; background: #ffffff; box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(7, 31, 58, 0.04); }
    .fact-card { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 60px 1fr; gap: 14px; align-items: center; padding: 22px; min-height: 126px; border-right: 1px solid var(--border); }
    .fact-card:last-child { border-right: none; }
    .fact-icon { width: 52px; height: 52px; border-radius: 50%; display: grid; place-items: center; background: var(--pale-teal); color: var(--teal); font-weight: 900; font-size: 24px; }
    .fact-card strong { display: block; color: var(--navy); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: 5px; }
    .fact-card span { display: block; color: var(--text); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.3; }
    .error-list { display: none; margin: 0 0 22px; padding: 14px 16px; border-radius: 12px; background: var(--error-bg); border: 1px solid #f4b8ae; color: var(--error); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; }
    .error-list.visible { display: block; }
    .discovery-grid { display: grid; gap: 18px; }
    .section-card { border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 22px; background: #ffffff; padding: 22px; }
    .section-title { margin: 0 0 18px; color: var(--navy); font-size: 21px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -0.015em; }
    .fields { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 18px; }
    .field.full { grid-column: span 2; }
    label.label { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px; align-items: baseline; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900; color: var(--navy); margin-bottom: 7px; }
    .required::after { content: ' *'; color: var(--teal); }
    .optional { color: var(--muted); font-weight: 800; font-size: 12px; }
    input, select { width: 100%; border: 1px solid #c9d9d8; border-radius: 15px; padding: 14px 15px; font-size: 15px; outline: none; background: #ffffff; color: var(--text); }
    input:focus, select:focus { border-color: var(--teal); box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(8, 122, 120, 0.12); }
    .help { color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4; margin-top: 6px; }
    .radio-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 12px; }
    .radio-card { border: 1px solid #c9d9d8; border-radius: 17px; padding: 15px; cursor: pointer; display: flex; gap: 11px; align-items: flex-start; min-height: 84px; }
    .radio-card:hover { border-color: var(--teal); box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(7, 31, 58, 0.05); }
    .radio-card:has(input:checked) { border-color: var(--teal); background: var(--pale-teal); box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(8, 122, 120, 0.09); }
    .radio-card input { width: auto; margin-top: 2px; }
    .radio-title { font-weight: 900; color: var(--navy); margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 15px; display: block; }
    .radio-help { color: var(--muted); font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.35; display: block; }
    .address-box, .area-box, .housing-cost-box, .upgrade-reason-box, .other-reason-box { margin-top: 18px; display: none; }
    .address-box.visible, .area-box.visible, .housing-cost-box.visible, .upgrade-reason-box.visible, .other-reason-box.visible { display: block; }
    .actions { margin-top: 30px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(280px, auto) auto 1fr; gap: 16px; align-items: center; }
    button { appearance: none; border: none; border-radius: 999px; padding: 16px 26px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 900; cursor: pointer; }
    .primary { background: var(--teal); color: #ffffff; box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(8, 122, 120, 0.22); }
    .primary:hover { background: var(--teal-dark); }
    .secondary { background: var(--pale-teal); color: var(--navy); }
    .safety { color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; }
    .safety strong { display: block; color: var(--navy); font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 3px; }
    #resetButton { background: transparent; color: var(--muted); box-shadow: none; padding-left: 8px; padding-right: 8px; }
    .confirm-panel { display: none; margin-top: 46px; padding: 34px; border-radius: 26px; border: 2px solid rgba(8,122,120,0.22); background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f3fbfa 0%, #ffffff 100%); box-shadow: 0 18px 42px rgba(7,31,58,0.08); }
    .confirm-panel.visible { display: block; }
    .confirm-panel h3 { margin: 0 0 8px; color: var(--navy); font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size: 40px; letter-spacing: -0.04em; }
    .confirm-intro { margin: 0 0 22px; color: var(--teal); font-weight: 900; line-height: 1.45; font-size: 16px; }
    .confirm-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 18px; border: 1px solid var(--border); background: #ffffff; margin-bottom: 22px; }
    .confirm-table th, .confirm-table td { text-align: left; vertical-align: top; padding: 14px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; }
    .confirm-table th { color: var(--navy); background: var(--pale-teal); font-weight: 900; }
    .confirm-table tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
    .confirm-detail { color: var(--navy); font-weight: 900; white-space: nowrap; }
    .emotional-close { margin: 0 0 20px; padding: 18px 20px; border-radius: 18px; background: var(--pale-teal); color: var(--navy); font-weight: 900; line-height: 1.45; }
    .confirm-buttons { display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }

    .hero-line { width: 54px; height: 4px; background: var(--teal); border-radius: 999px; margin: 0 0 18px; }
    .personal-line { margin-top: 18px; display: inline-block; padding: 12px 14px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 999px; background: #ffffff; color: var(--teal); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 900; }
    .waiting-tax { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 84px 1fr minmax(280px, 360px); gap: 20px; align-items: center; padding: 22px 26px; border-radius: 20px; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f6fbfb 0%, #ffffff 100%); border: 1px solid var(--border); margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .market-panel { align-self: stretch; border-left: 1px solid var(--border); padding-left: 20px; display: grid; align-content: center; gap: 12px; }
    .market-panel h4 { margin: 0; color: var(--navy); font-size: 15px; font-weight: 900; }
    .market-panel p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.4; font-weight: 700; }
    .market-controls { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 10px; }
    .market-field label { display: block; color: var(--navy); font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.2; font-weight: 900; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.04em; margin-bottom: 5px; }
    .market-field select, .market-field input { padding: 10px 11px; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800; }
    .custom-growth { display: none; margin-top: 8px; }
    .custom-growth.visible { display: block; }
    .market-note { color: var(--muted); font-size: 11.5px; line-height: 1.35; font-weight: 700; }
    .big-icon { width: 70px; height: 70px; border-radius: 50%; display: grid; place-items: center; background: var(--teal); color: #ffffff; font-size: 34px; font-weight: 900; }
    .waiting-tax .label { color: var(--teal); font-weight: 900; font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 2px; }
    .waiting-tax .amount { color: var(--teal); font-weight: 900; font-size: 58px; line-height: 0.95; letter-spacing: -0.04em; font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; }
    .waiting-tax .subtext { margin-top: 8px; color: var(--navy); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 800; }
    .two-cards { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 18px; align-items: stretch; position: relative; margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .plus-circle { position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--teal); color: #ffffff; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 900; box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(8, 122, 120, 0.20); z-index: 2; }
    .insight-card { border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 20px; background: #ffffff; padding: 22px; min-height: 310px; }
    .number-badge { width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--teal); color: #ffffff; display: grid; place-items: center; font-weight: 900; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .insight-top { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 74px 1fr; gap: 16px; align-items: start; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .line-icon { width: 68px; height: 68px; border-radius: 50%; display: grid; place-items: center; background: var(--pale-teal); color: var(--navy); font-size: 34px; font-weight: 900; }
    .insight-card h4 { margin: 0 0 8px; color: var(--navy); font-size: 17px; font-weight: 900; }
    .insight-card p { margin: 0; color: var(--navy); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.45; font-weight: 700; }
    .cost-box { margin-top: 16px; border-radius: 16px; background: #f4fbfa; border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 16px; }
    .cost-label { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 900; margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .cost-amount { color: var(--teal); font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size: 34px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .cost-text { color: var(--navy); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.35; font-weight: 800; }
    .choice { background: var(--navy); border-radius: 22px; padding: 18px; color: #ffffff; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .choice h3 { margin: 0 0 14px; text-align: center; color: #ffffff; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 900; }
    .choice-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 56px 1fr; gap: 12px; align-items: stretch; }
    .choice-card { background: #ffffff; color: var(--navy); border-radius: 16px; padding: 18px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 60px 1fr; gap: 14px; align-items: center; min-height: 130px; }
    .choice-icon { width: 54px; height: 54px; border-radius: 50%; display: grid; place-items: center; background: var(--pale-teal); color: var(--teal); font-size: 27px; font-weight: 900; }
    .red { color: #c62828; font-weight: 900; font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 3px; }
    .green { color: var(--teal); font-weight: 900; font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 3px; }
    .choice-number { color: var(--teal); font-weight: 900; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .choice-copy { color: var(--navy); font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.35; font-weight: 800; }
    .or-circle { width: 52px; height: 52px; border-radius: 50%; background: #ffffff; color: var(--navy); display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 900; justify-self: center; align-self: center; }
    .assumptions { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; align-items: center; color: var(--muted); font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.45; margin-top: 14px; }
    .mini-brand { display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; color: var(--navy); font-weight: 900; white-space: nowrap; }
    .home-mark { width: 28px; height: 24px; position: relative; border: 3px solid var(--teal); border-top: none; border-radius: 2px; }
    .home-mark::before { content: ''; position: absolute; left: -4px; top: -13px; width: 22px; height: 22px; border-left: 3px solid var(--teal); border-top: 3px solid var(--teal); transform: rotate(45deg); }

    .section-heading { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr; gap: 16px; align-items: center; color: var(--navy); font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size: 30px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -0.03em; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 10px; }
    .illustrative-note { margin: 0 0 22px; text-align: center; color: var(--muted); font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 800; }
    .section-heading::before, .section-heading::after { content: ''; height: 2px; background: var(--border); }
    .reality-grid, .shift-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 28px; }
    .reality-card, .shift-card { border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 20px; background: #ffffff; padding: 20px; min-height: 180px; box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(7, 31, 58, 0.04); }
    .reality-icon { width: 46px; height: 46px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--pale-teal); color: var(--teal); display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 23px; font-weight: 900; margin-bottom: 14px; }
    .card-label, .shift-card h4 { color: var(--navy); font-size: 15px; font-weight: 900; margin: 0 0 8px; }
    .card-value { color: var(--teal); font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size: 34px; font-weight: 900; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.035em; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .card-copy, .shift-card p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; font-weight: 700; margin: 0; }
    .bridge { border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 24px; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0%, #f4fbfa 100%); padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 28px; }
    .bridge h3 { margin: 0 0 22px; text-align: center; color: var(--navy); font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size: 30px; letter-spacing: -0.03em; }
    .equation { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 48px 1fr 48px 1fr; gap: 12px; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 22px; }
    .equation-card { min-height: 132px; border-radius: 20px; background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 20px; text-align: center; display: grid; align-content: center; }
    .equation-card strong { display: block; color: var(--teal); font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size: 31px; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.035em; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .equation-card span { display: block; color: var(--navy); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 900; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.04em; }
    .symbol { width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--teal); color: #ffffff; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 900; justify-self: center; }
    .result-line { margin: 0; padding: 16px 18px; border-radius: 16px; background: var(--navy); color: #ffffff; text-align: center; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.45; font-weight: 900; }
    .footer-statement { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 54px 1fr; gap: 14px; align-items: center; background: var(--navy); color: #ffffff; border-radius: 22px; padding: 20px 22px; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.35; font-weight: 900; }
    .footer-icon { width: 50px; height: 50px; border-radius: 50%; display: grid; place-items: center; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.12); color: #ffffff; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 900; }


    .ownership-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 18px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .ownership-panel { border-radius: 20px; border: 1px solid var(--border); background: #ffffff; overflow: hidden; }
    .ownership-panel-header { padding: 13px 16px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 900; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-align: center; }
    .ownership-gains .ownership-panel-header { color: var(--teal); background: var(--pale-teal); }
    .ownership-costs .ownership-panel-header { color: #b36b00; background: #fff5df; }
    .ownership-line { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50px 1fr auto; gap: 12px; align-items: center; padding: 15px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
    .ownership-line:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .own-icon { width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--teal); color: #ffffff; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 900; }
    .ownership-costs .own-icon { background: #d99a22; }
    .own-label { color: var(--navy); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 900; margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .own-copy { color: var(--muted); font-size: 11.5px; line-height: 1.35; font-weight: 700; }
    .own-amount { color: var(--teal); font-size: 18px; font-weight: 900; white-space: nowrap; }
    .ownership-costs .own-amount { color: #c77b00; }
    .own-total { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; align-items: center; padding: 16px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900; color: var(--teal); background: #f8fcfb; }
    .ownership-costs .own-total { color: #c77b00; background: #fffaf0; }
    .bottom-line-box { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 0.92fr 1.08fr; gap: 20px; padding: 22px; border-radius: 22px; border: 1px solid var(--border); background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0%, #f4fbfa 100%); margin-bottom: 18px; }
    .bottom-line-left { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 72px 1fr; gap: 16px; align-items: center; border-right: 1px solid var(--border); padding-right: 18px; }
    .trophy { width: 62px; height: 62px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--teal); color: #ffffff; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 900; }
    .bottom-heading { color: var(--navy); font-size: 20px; font-weight: 900; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .bottom-metric { color: var(--teal); font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.05; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -0.03em; }
    .bottom-metric span { display: block; color: var(--navy); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 0; margin-top: 3px; }
    .bottom-right h4 { margin: 0 0 10px; color: var(--navy); font-size: 17px; font-weight: 900; }
    .bottom-right p { margin: 0 0 10px; color: var(--text); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.45; font-weight: 700; }
    .result-list { margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; display: grid; gap: 6px; }
    .result-list li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 22px 1fr; gap: 8px; align-items: start; font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.35; color: var(--text); font-weight: 800; }
    .small-check { width: 20px; height: 20px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--teal); color: #ffffff; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 900; }
    .footer-strip { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 42px 1fr auto; gap: 12px; align-items: center; border-radius: 16px; background: var(--navy); color: #ffffff; padding: 14px 18px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 900; }
    .footer-strip span:last-child { color: #ffcf46; }
    .footer-home { width: 34px; height: 34px; border-radius: 50%; display: grid; place-items: center; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.12); color: #ffffff; font-size: 20px; }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .brand, .brand-row { display: block; }
      .progress { margin-top: 18px; text-align: left; }
      .hero h2 { font-size: 34px; }
      .fact-strip, .fields, .radio-row, .reality-grid, .shift-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .field.full { grid-column: span 1; }
      .actions { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .waiting-tax, .insight-top, .choice-card { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .market-panel { border-left: none; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); padding-left: 0; padding-top: 18px; }
      .market-controls { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .two-cards, .choice-grid, .equation { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .plus-circle, .or-circle { position: static; transform: none; margin: 0 auto; }
      .assumptions { display: block; }
      .mini-brand { margin-top: 12px; }
      .symbol { margin: 0 auto; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 560px) {
      .page { padding: 22px 12px; }
      .hero, .form-area, .content { padding-left: 20px; padding-right: 20px; }
      .brand h1, .brand-block h1 { font-size: 36px; }
      .waiting-tax .amount { font-size: 44px; }
      .section-heading { font-size: 25px; }
    }
  

    /* Final UX pass and Page 5 */
    #screen1 .section-card { padding: 18px; }
    #screen1 .discovery-grid { gap: 14px; }
    #screen1 .form-area { padding-top: 24px; }
    #screen1 .fact-title { font-size: 19px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
    #screen1 .fact-card { min-height: 96px; padding: 16px; }
    #screen1 .fact-icon { width: 46px; height: 46px; }
    #screen1ActionBar { position: sticky; bottom: 18px; z-index: 20; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.94); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 999px; padding: 12px 14px; box-shadow: 0 14px 40px rgba(7,31,58,0.12); backdrop-filter: blur(10px); }
    #screen1.confirm-mode .fact-title,
    #screen1.confirm-mode .fact-strip,
    #screen1.confirm-mode .discovery-grid,
    #screen1.confirm-mode #screen1ActionBar,
    #screen1.confirm-mode #errors { display: none !important; }
    #screen1.confirm-mode .confirm-panel { display: block !important; margin-top: 0; }
    #screen1.confirm-mode .form-area { padding-top: 34px; }

    .scenario-chip { display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 8px; padding: 7px 10px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--pale-teal); color: var(--navy); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 900; }
    .market-panel { align-self: stretch; border-left: 0; border: 1px solid rgba(215,229,228,0.9); border-radius: 16px; padding: 14px; background: rgba(234,246,245,0.42); gap: 10px; }
    .market-panel h4 { font-size: 14px; }
    .market-panel p { font-size: 11.5px; line-height: 1.35; }
    .market-controls { gap: 8px; }
    .market-field select, .market-field input { padding: 8px 9px; min-height: 38px; }
    .market-note { font-size: 10.8px; }
    .insight-card { padding: 18px; min-height: 270px; }
    .insight-top { margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .choice { padding: 22px; }
    .choice h3 { font-size: 22px; }
    .choice-card { min-height: 145px; padding: 22px; }
    .choice-card .red, .choice-card .green { font-size: 17px; }

    #screenBridge .content { padding-top: 24px; }
    #screenBridge .reality-grid { gap: 14px; margin-bottom: 22px; }
    #screenBridge .reality-card { padding: 16px; min-height: 145px; }
    #screenBridge .bridge { padding: 22px; margin-bottom: 24px; box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(7,31,58,0.06); }
    #screenBridge .bridge h3 { margin-bottom: 18px; }
    #screenBridge .equation-card { min-height: 110px; padding: 16px; }
    #screenBridge .symbol { width: 58px; height: 58px; font-size: 30px; }
    #screenBridge .result-line { margin-top: 2px; }
    #screenBridge .shift-grid { gap: 14px; }
    #screenBridge .shift-card { min-height: 135px; padding: 18px; }
    #screenBridge .shift-card h4 { font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 8px; }

    #screenOwnership .hero { padding-top: 30px; padding-bottom: 20px; }
    #screenOwnership .bottom-line-box { padding: 28px; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #eef8f7 0%, #ffffff 100%); border-width: 2px; }
    #screenOwnership .bottom-metric { font-size: 38px; }
    #screenOwnership .footer-strip { background: #f4fbfa; color: var(--navy); border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 12px 16px; min-height: 0; }
    #screenOwnership .footer-home { background: var(--pale-teal); color: var(--teal); }
    #screenOwnership .footer-strip span:last-child { color: var(--teal); }

    .ready-hero { padding-bottom: 24px; }
    .ready-content { padding-top: 26px; }
    .reassurance-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 14px; margin-bottom: 28px; }
    .reassurance-card { background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 18px; padding: 17px; min-height: 160px; }
    .reassurance-icon { width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--pale-teal); color: var(--teal); display: grid; place-items: center; font-weight: 900; font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .reassurance-card h4 { margin: 0 0 8px; color: var(--navy); font-size: 15px; font-weight: 900; }
    .reassurance-card p { margin: 0; color: var(--text); font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.4; font-weight: 700; }
    .ready-heading { margin: 8px 0 18px; color: var(--navy); font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size: 34px; letter-spacing: -0.035em; }
    .next-step-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 0.9fr 1.1fr; gap: 18px; align-items: stretch; margin-bottom: 18px; }
    .apply-card, .report-card, .save-card { border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 22px; background: #fff; padding: 24px; }
    .apply-card { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #eef8f7 0%, #ffffff 100%); border-width: 2px; }
    .apply-card h4, .report-card h4, .save-card h4 { margin: 0 0 8px; color: var(--teal); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 900; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .04em; }
    .apply-card h3, .report-card h3 { margin: 0 0 10px; color: var(--navy); font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size: 28px; letter-spacing: -0.03em; }
    .apply-card p, .report-card p, .save-card p { margin: 0 0 14px; color: var(--text); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.45; font-weight: 700; }
    .step-pill { width: 34px; height: 34px; border-radius: 50%; display: grid; place-items: center; background: var(--teal); color: #fff; font-weight: 900; margin-bottom: 14px; }
    .step-pill.pale { background: var(--pale-teal); color: var(--teal); }
    .report-card { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 210px 1fr; gap: 20px; align-items: center; background: #f8fcfb; }
    .report-graphic { min-height: 230px; border-radius: 18px; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0%, #eaf6f5 100%); border: 1px solid var(--border); display: grid; place-items: center; }
    .report-sheet { width: 145px; min-height: 175px; border-radius: 14px; background: #fff; box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(7,31,58,.12); padding: 18px; }
    .report-line { height: 9px; border-radius: 99px; background: #d7e5e4; margin-bottom: 11px; }
    .report-line.strong { background: var(--teal); width: 92%; }
    .report-line.short { width: 60%; }
    .report-box-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3,1fr); gap: 8px; margin-top: 28px; }
    .report-box-row span { height: 34px; border-radius: 8px; background: var(--pale-teal); }
    .report-items { display: grid; gap: 8px; }
    .report-items div { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 22px 1fr; gap: 8px; align-items: start; }
    .report-items span { width: 20px; height: 20px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--teal); color: #fff; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 900; }
    .report-items p { margin: 0; font-size: 12.6px; line-height: 1.35; }
    .save-card { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 18px; align-items: center; padding: 18px 20px; background: #fff; }
    .save-card h4 { color: var(--navy); text-transform: none; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0; }
    .save-card p { margin: 0; }
    .final-disclaimer { margin: 22px 0 0; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); color: var(--muted); font-size: 11.5px; line-height: 1.45; max-width: 900px; }

    @media (max-width: 1000px) { .reassurance-grid, .next-step-grid, .report-card { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
    @media (max-width: 900px) { #screen1ActionBar { position: static; border-radius: 22px; } .waiting-tax { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .market-panel { border-left: none; } }


    /* Hybrid visual upgrade layer */
    .market-movement {
      margin-top: 16px;
      max-width: 430px;
      padding: 14px 16px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: rgba(234,246,245,0.65);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .movement-row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 58px 1fr;
      gap: 10px;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .movement-point {
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 10px 12px;
      min-height: 72px;
    }
    .movement-label {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 900;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: .05em;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }
    .movement-value {
      color: var(--navy);
      font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    }
    .movement-arrow {
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      color: var(--teal);
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: 900;
    }
    .movement-caption {
      margin-top: 10px;
      color: var(--teal);
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.35;
      font-weight: 900;
    }

    .deposit-bridge-visual {
      position: relative;
      padding-top: 10px;
    }
    .deposit-bridge-visual::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      left: 15%;
      right: 15%;
      top: 70px;
      height: 3px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(8,122,120,0.18), rgba(8,122,120,0.75), rgba(8,122,120,0.18));
      z-index: 0;
    }
    .deposit-bridge-visual .equation-card,
    .deposit-bridge-visual .symbol { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
    .deposit-bridge-visual .equation-card:nth-of-type(2) {
      border-color: rgba(8,122,120,0.35);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(8,122,120,0.09);
    }
    .milestone-note {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 8px;
      padding: 5px 9px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--pale-teal);
      color: var(--teal);
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 900;
      text-transform: none;
      letter-spacing: 0;
    }

    .ownership-timeline {
      margin: 24px 44px 0;
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 22px;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0%, #f4fbfa 100%);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .ownership-timeline-title {
      margin: 0 0 16px;
      color: var(--navy);
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 900;
    }
    .timeline-steps {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 14px;
      position: relative;
    }
    .timeline-steps::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      left: 8%;
      right: 8%;
      top: 26px;
      height: 3px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(8,122,120,0.22);
      z-index: 0;
    }
    .timeline-step {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      text-align: center;
      display: grid;
      justify-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }
    .timeline-icon {
      width: 54px;
      height: 54px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      background: var(--teal);
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 23px;
      font-weight: 900;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(8,122,120,0.18);
    }
    .timeline-step h4 {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--navy);
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 900;
    }
    .timeline-step p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.35;
      font-weight: 700;
      max-width: 170px;
    }

    .ready-hero-split {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 360px;
      gap: 28px;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .ready-hero-split .promise { margin-bottom: 0; }
    .final-trust-visual {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 230px;
      border-radius: 24px;
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 68% 36%, rgba(255,255,255,0.94) 0 7%, transparent 8%),
        linear-gradient(135deg, #dbeceb 0%, #ffffff 45%, #cfe5e2 100%);
      box-shadow: 0 18px 42px rgba(7,31,58,0.10);
    }
    .final-home-shape {
      position: absolute;
      right: 24px;
      top: 42px;
      width: 190px;
      height: 118px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.75);
      border: 1px solid rgba(7,31,58,0.08);
    }
    .final-home-shape::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      left: 25px;
      top: -34px;
      width: 132px;
      height: 72px;
      transform: skew(-24deg);
      background: var(--navy);
      border-radius: 12px 12px 0 0;
      opacity: 0.9;
    }
    .final-badge {
      position: absolute;
      left: 22px;
      right: 22px;
      bottom: 22px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 42px 1fr;
      gap: 12px;
      align-items: center;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 14px 16px;
      background: rgba(8,122,120,0.96);
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.25;
      font-weight: 900;
      box-shadow: 0 14px 30px rgba(7,31,58,0.16);
    }
    .final-badge-icon {
      width: 42px;
      height: 42px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      font-size: 20px;
    }

    .proof-strip {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 18px;
      background: #ffffff;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .proof-item {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 34px 1fr;
      gap: 9px;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 12px 14px;
      border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
      min-height: 70px;
    }
    .proof-item:last-child { border-right: none; }
    .proof-icon {
      width: 34px;
      height: 34px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--pale-teal);
      color: var(--teal);
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      font-size: 17px;
      font-weight: 900;
    }
    .proof-text {
      color: var(--text);
      font-size: 12.5px;
      line-height: 1.3;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .proof-text strong {
      color: var(--navy);
      font-weight: 900;
    }

    #screenReady .apply-card {
      display: grid;
      align-content: start;
      min-height: 0;
      padding: 22px;
    }
    #screenReady .report-card {
      box-shadow: 0 12px 34px rgba(7,31,58,0.06);
    }

    @media (max-width: 1000px) {
      .proof-strip, .timeline-steps, .ready-hero-split { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .proof-item { border-right: none; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
      .proof-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
      .timeline-steps::before { display: none; }
      .ownership-timeline { margin: 20px 20px 0; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .movement-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .movement-arrow { transform: rotate(90deg); }
      .deposit-bridge-visual::before { display: none; }
      .final-trust-visual { min-height: 220px; }
    }

  

/* Visual refinement pass - coded from briefing */
.hero-with-image {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(320px, 40%);
  gap: 30px;
  align-items: center;
}
.hero-with-image .hero-copy { min-width: 0; }
.hero-with-image .hero-copy .promise { max-width: 760px; }
.hero-image-panel {
  width: 100%;
  height: clamp(220px, 24vw, 300px);
  border-radius: 24px;
  overflow: hidden;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  box-shadow: 0 18px 42px rgba(7,31,58,0.12);
  background: var(--pale-teal);
}
.hero-image-panel img,
.final-trust-visual img,
.report-graphic img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  display: block;
  object-fit: cover;
}
#screen1 .hero-image-panel img { object-position: 52% 45%; }
#screen2 .hero-image-panel img,
#screenCompromise .hero-image-panel img { object-position: 50% 52%; }
#screenBridge .hero-image-panel img { object-position: 50% 45%; }
#screenOwnership .hero-image-panel img { object-position: 50% 52%; }
#screenReady .photo-panel img { object-position: 50% 50%; }

/* Page 1 problem cards */
.fact-strip {
  gap: 14px !important;
  border: 0 !important;
  background: transparent !important;
  box-shadow: none !important;
  overflow: visible !important;
}
.fact-card {
  border: 1px solid var(--border) !important;
  border-radius: 18px;
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0%, #f4fbfa 100%);
  box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(7,31,58,0.04);
  min-height: 96px !important;
  padding: 17px 18px !important;
}
.fact-card:last-child { border-right: 1px solid var(--border) !important; }
.fact-icon {
  width: 48px !important;
  height: 48px !important;
  font-size: 18px !important;
  letter-spacing: -0.06em;
}
.fact-card strong { font-size: 16px; }
.fact-card span { color: var(--muted); font-weight: 700; }

/* Page 2 explanation cards */
.insight-card {
  padding: 18px !important;
  min-height: 260px !important;
}
.insight-top {
  grid-template-columns: 62px 1fr !important;
  gap: 14px !important;
  margin-bottom: 12px !important;
}
.line-icon {
  width: 58px !important;
  height: 58px !important;
  font-size: 21px !important;
  letter-spacing: -0.06em;
}
.number-badge {
  width: 28px !important;
  height: 28px !important;
  margin-bottom: 10px !important;
}
.cost-box { margin-top: 12px !important; }

/* Page 2 choice panel: remove icons and make it text-led */
.choice-card {
  display: block !important;
  min-height: 128px !important;
  padding: 24px 28px !important;
}
.choice-card .choice-icon { display: none !important; }
.choice-card .red,
.choice-card .green {
  font-size: 17px !important;
  margin-bottom: 8px !important;
}
.choice-number {
  font-size: 25px !important;
  margin-bottom: 7px !important;
}
.choice-copy { font-size: 13.5px !important; }

/* Page 3 Reality Check and bridge equation refinements */
#screenBridge .reality-icon { display: none !important; }
#screenBridge .reality-card {
  min-height: 138px !important;
  padding: 22px 24px !important;
}
#screenBridge .bridge { padding: 26px !important; }
#screenBridge .equation {
  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto minmax(0, 1.12fr) auto minmax(0, 1fr) !important;
  gap: 14px !important;
  align-items: center;
}
.connector-label {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
  display: inline-grid;
  place-items: center;
  min-width: 64px;
  height: 30px;
  padding: 0 12px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: var(--pale-teal);
  border: 1px solid rgba(8,122,120,0.22);
  color: var(--teal);
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 900;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: .06em;
  justify-self: center;
}
.deposit-bridge-visual::before { top: 62px !important; }
.deposit-bridge-visual .equation-card:nth-of-type(2) {
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f4fbfa 0%, #ffffff 100%);
  border-color: rgba(8,122,120,0.38) !important;
}
.milestone-note {
  padding: 4px 9px !important;
  font-size: 10.5px !important;
}

/* Page 4 text-based pathway */
.ownership-timeline {
  padding: 18px 22px !important;
}
.timeline-steps::before {
  top: 18px !important;
  left: 12% !important;
  right: 12% !important;
}
.timeline-step { gap: 8px !important; }
.timeline-marker {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  min-height: 38px;
  padding: 8px 16px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: var(--teal);
  color: #fff;
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 900;
  box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(8,122,120,0.16);
  white-space: nowrap;
}
.timeline-step p { margin-top: 2px; }
.timeline-icon { display: none !important; }

/* Page 4 financial statement refinements */
.ownership-line {
  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto !important;
  gap: 16px !important;
  padding: 17px 18px !important;
}
.own-icon { display: none !important; }
.own-label { font-size: 14px !important; }
.own-copy { font-size: 12px !important; }
.own-amount { font-size: 20px !important; }
.bottom-line-left {
  grid-template-columns: 1fr !important;
  gap: 0 !important;
}
.trophy { display: none !important; }
.small-check {
  width: 18px !important;
  height: 18px !important;
  font-size: 11px !important;
}

/* Page 5 photographic hero and roadmap image */
.final-trust-visual.photo-panel {
  min-height: 280px;
  background: #eaf6f5;
}
.final-trust-visual.photo-panel .hero-photo {
  filter: saturate(1.02) contrast(1.02);
}
.final-trust-visual.photo-panel::after {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(7,31,58,0.02) 0%, rgba(7,31,58,0.20) 100%);
  pointer-events: none;
}
.final-trust-visual.photo-panel .final-badge { z-index: 2; }
.report-graphic {
  overflow: hidden;
  min-height: 230px;
}
.report-graphic .roadmap-photo {
  border-radius: 18px;
  object-position: 50% 48%;
}

@media (max-width: 1000px) {
  .hero-with-image,
  .ready-hero-split {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr !important;
  }
  .hero-image-panel { height: 240px; }
  .final-trust-visual.photo-panel { min-height: 240px; }
  .timeline-steps::before { display: none !important; }
  .timeline-marker { width: 100%; max-width: 260px; }
}
@media (max-width: 900px) {
  #screenBridge .equation {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr !important;
  }
  .connector-label { margin: 0 auto; }
}
@media (max-width: 560px) {
  .hero-image-panel { height: 220px; }
  .fact-card { grid-template-columns: 1fr !important; text-align: left; }
  .fact-icon { margin-bottom: 2px; }
  .ownership-line { grid-template-columns: 1fr !important; }
  .own-amount { margin-top: 8px; }
}


/* Page 4 final render: simplified ownership page */
#screenOwnership .ownership-hero {
  padding-top: 42px;
  padding-bottom: 34px;
  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(270px, 34%);
  gap: 42px;
}
#screenOwnership .hero-image-panel {
  height: clamp(185px, 20.4vw, 255px);
  max-width: 85%;
  justify-self: end;
}
#screenOwnership .hero-copy h3 {
  max-width: 720px;
  margin: 0;
  color: var(--navy);
  font-size: 22px;
  line-height: 1.45;
  font-weight: 900;
}
#screenOwnership .ownership-timeline {
  margin: 28px 44px 0;
  padding: 22px 28px 28px !important;
  border-radius: 22px;
  background: #ffffff;
}
#screenOwnership .ownership-timeline-title {
  text-align: center;
  font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
  font-size: 27px;
  letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  margin: 0 0 22px;
}
#screenOwnership .timeline-steps {
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  gap: 46px;
}
#screenOwnership .timeline-steps::before {
  display: none !important;
}
#screenOwnership .timeline-step {
  position: relative;
  min-height: 150px;
  padding: 26px 20px 22px;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 18px;
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0%, #f7fcfb 100%);
  box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(7,31,58,0.035);
  display: grid;
  align-content: center;
  justify-items: center;
  gap: 14px !important;
}
#screenOwnership .timeline-step:not(:last-child)::after {
  content: '›';
  position: absolute;
  right: -32px;
  top: 50%;
  transform: translateY(-50%);
  color: var(--teal);
  font-size: 42px;
  line-height: 1;
  font-weight: 400;
}
#screenOwnership .timeline-marker {
  display: block;
  min-height: 0;
  padding: 0;
  border-radius: 0;
  background: transparent;
  color: var(--teal);
  box-shadow: none;
  font-size: 20px;
  line-height: 1.15;
  white-space: normal;
}
#screenOwnership .timeline-step p {
  max-width: 180px;
  color: var(--navy);
  font-size: 16px;
  line-height: 1.45;
  font-weight: 700;
}
#screenOwnership .ownership-content {
  padding-top: 28px;
}
#screenOwnership .section-heading {
  margin-top: 0;
  font-size: 31px;
}
#screenOwnership .ownership-grid {
  gap: 28px;
  align-items: stretch;
  margin-bottom: 26px;
}
#screenOwnership .ownership-panel {
  border-radius: 18px;
}
#screenOwnership .ownership-panel-header {
  font-size: 20px;
  text-transform: none;
  letter-spacing: 0;
  font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
  padding: 20px 22px;
}
#screenOwnership .ownership-line {
  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto !important;
  padding: 24px 28px !important;
  min-height: 130px;
}
#screenOwnership .ownership-line-single {
  min-height: 210px;
}
#screenOwnership .own-label {
  font-size: 17px !important;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}
#screenOwnership .own-copy {
  max-width: 330px;
  color: var(--navy);
  font-size: 16px !important;
  line-height: 1.55;
  font-weight: 700;
}
#screenOwnership .own-amount {
  align-self: center;
  color: var(--teal);
  font-size: 27px !important;
  font-weight: 900;
}
#screenOwnership .ownership-costs .own-amount,
#screenOwnership .ownership-costs .own-total {
  color: #c77b00;
}
#screenOwnership .own-total {
  padding: 20px 28px;
  font-size: 18px;
}
#screenOwnership .ownership-bottom-box {
  grid-template-columns: 0.78fr 1.22fr;
  gap: 32px;
  padding: 34px 38px 24px !important;
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f5fbfa 0%, #ffffff 100%);
  border-width: 2px;
}
#screenOwnership .bottom-line-left {
  border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
  padding-right: 30px;
  display: grid;
  align-content: center;
}
#screenOwnership .bottom-heading {
  font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
  font-size: 31px;
  letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  margin-bottom: 18px;
}
#screenOwnership .bottom-metric {
  font-size: 47px !important;
}
#screenOwnership .bottom-metric span {
  color: var(--teal);
  font-size: 25px;
  font-weight: 900;
  margin-top: 8px;
}
#screenOwnership .bottom-right {
  align-self: center;
}
#screenOwnership .bottom-right h4 {
  font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
  font-size: 20px;
  letter-spacing: -0.015em;
  margin-bottom: 18px;
}
#screenOwnership .result-list {
  gap: 14px;
}
#screenOwnership .result-list li {
  grid-template-columns: 26px 1fr;
  gap: 12px;
  font-size: 16px;
  line-height: 1.45;
}
#screenOwnership .small-check {
  width: 24px !important;
  height: 24px !important;
  font-size: 14px !important;
}
#screenOwnership .ownership-final-statement {
  grid-column: 1 / -1;
  margin-top: 22px;
  padding-top: 20px;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  text-align: center;
  color: var(--teal);
  font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
  font-size: 27px;
  line-height: 1.25;
  font-weight: 900;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
}
#screenOwnership .actions {
  margin-top: 22px;
}
@media (max-width: 1000px) {
  #screenOwnership .ownership-hero,
  #screenOwnership .ownership-grid,
  #screenOwnership .ownership-bottom-box {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr !important;
  }
  #screenOwnership .hero-image-panel {
    max-width: 100%;
    justify-self: stretch;
  }
  #screenOwnership .timeline-steps {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 14px;
  }
  #screenOwnership .timeline-step:not(:last-child)::after {
    display: none;
  }
  #screenOwnership .bottom-line-left {
    border-right: 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding-right: 0;
    padding-bottom: 22px;
  }
}
@media (max-width: 560px) {
  #screenOwnership .ownership-timeline {
    margin-left: 20px;
    margin-right: 20px;
  }
  #screenOwnership .ownership-line {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr !important;
    min-height: 0;
  }
  #screenOwnership .own-amount {
    justify-self: start;
  }
  #screenOwnership .bottom-metric {
    font-size: 39px !important;
  }
}


    /* Page 1 UX/CX refinements */
    #screen1 .hero { padding: 44px 44px 34px; }
    #screen1 .hero-with-image { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.08fr) minmax(280px, 0.92fr); gap: 26px; align-items: stretch; }
    #screen1 .hero-copy { display: grid; align-content: center; gap: 14px; }
    #screen1 .hero h2 { margin-bottom: 0; max-width: 20ch; }
    #screen1 .hero .promise { margin: 0; max-width: 58ch; line-height: 1.55; }
    #screen1 .hero-image-panel { border-radius: 20px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid var(--border); box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(7,31,58,0.09); min-height: 280px; }
    #screen1 .hero-photo { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; }
    #screen1 .fields { gap: 16px 20px; }
    #screen1 input, #screen1 select { min-height: 48px; }
    #screen1 .actions { margin-top: 34px; grid-template-columns: minmax(260px, auto) auto 1fr; }
    #screen1 .primary, #screen1 .secondary { min-height: 52px; }

    @media (max-width: 1024px) {
      #screen1 .hero-with-image { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      #screen1 .hero-image-panel { min-height: 220px; }
      #screen1 .hero h2, #screen1 .hero .promise { max-width: 100%; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 560px) {
      #screen1 .hero { padding: 26px 20px 24px; }
      #screen1 .form-area { padding-top: 18px; }
      #screen1 .section-card { border-radius: 18px; padding: 16px; }
      #screen1 .radio-card { min-height: 72px; }
      #screen1ActionBar { left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 10px; border-radius: 18px; }
    }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main class="page">
<section class="shell">
<section class="screen active" id="screen1">
<div class="brand">
<h1>BuySooner</h1><div class="brand-line"></div><p>Buy sooner. Buy smarter.</p>
</div>
<div class="card">
<section class="hero hero-with-image"><div class="hero-copy"><h2>It’s never been harder to achieve the Great Australian Dream.</h2><p class="promise">Answer a few questions and we’ll show what waiting may be costing you, and how BuySooner may change the equation.</p></div><div class="hero-image-panel"><img alt="Couple holding keys to their new home" class="hero-photo" src="p1.jpg"/></div></section>
<section class="form-area">
<form id="scenarioForm" novalidate="">
<p class="fact-title">It’s never been harder to buy your first home or move into a home you actually want.</p>
<div class="fact-strip"><div class="fact-card"><div class="fact-icon">⌂↗</div><div><strong>Prices keep rising</strong><span>The goalposts keep moving.</span></div></div><div class="fact-card"><div class="fact-icon">$⌂</div><div><strong>Renting isn’t building your future</strong><span>Every week is dead money.</span></div></div><div class="fact-card"><div class="fact-icon">◷$</div><div><strong>Deposits take years to save</strong><span>Time is your biggest barrier.</span></div></div></div>
<div class="error-list" id="errors"></div>
<div class="discovery-grid">
<section class="section-card"><h3 class="section-title">Your details</h3><div class="fields"><div class="field full"><label class="label required" for="customerName"><span>Name</span></label><input id="customerName" placeholder="Sarah and James" type="text"/><div class="help">Who are we building this roadmap for?</div></div></div></section>
<section class="section-card"><h3 class="section-title">Where are you today?</h3><div class="radio-row"><label class="radio-card"><input name="buyerSituation" type="radio" value="renting"/><span><span class="radio-title">Renting now</span><span class="radio-help">Breaking the rent cycle.</span></span></label><label class="radio-card"><input name="buyerSituation" type="radio" value="upgrading"/><span><span class="radio-title">Own and upgrading</span><span class="radio-help">Making your next move.</span></span></label></div></section>
<section class="section-card"><h3 class="section-title">What do you want to buy?</h3><div class="fields"><div class="field full"><label class="label required" for="purchasePrice"><span>Target purchase price</span></label><input data-money="true" id="purchasePrice" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="$1,500,000"/><div class="help">The price of your future home.</div></div><div class="field full"><label class="label"><span>Do you have a specific property in mind?</span><span class="optional">Optional</span></label><div class="radio-row"><label class="radio-card"><input checked="" name="addressKnown" type="radio" value="no"/><span><span class="radio-title">Not yet</span><span class="radio-help">Use local market averages.</span></span></label><label class="radio-card"><input name="addressKnown" type="radio" value="yes"/><span><span class="radio-title">Yes, add address</span><span class="radio-help">Get property-specific insights.</span></span></label></div><div class="area-box visible" id="areaBox"><label class="label required" for="targetArea"><span>Target area</span></label><select id="targetArea"><option value="">Choose a Sydney area</option><option>Lower North Shore</option><option>Upper North Shore</option><option>Northern Beaches</option><option>Eastern Suburbs</option><option>Inner West</option><option>City / Inner Sydney</option><option>Hills District</option><option>Parramatta / Greater West</option><option>Sutherland Shire</option><option>South West Sydney</option><option>Other Sydney area</option></select><div class="help">Choose the area you are aiming for.</div></div><div class="address-box" id="addressBox"><label class="label required" for="address"><span>Property address</span></label><input id="address" placeholder="15 Example Street, St Leonards NSW 2065" type="text"/><div class="help">Start typing the address.</div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section-card"><h3 class="section-title">What do you have now?</h3><div class="fields"><div class="field full"><label class="label required" for="deposit"><span>Your contribution</span></label><input data-money="true" id="deposit" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="$150,000"/><div class="help" id="depositHelp">Savings or deposit you can put towards buying your home.</div></div></div><div class="housing-cost-box" id="housingCostBox"><div class="fields"><div class="field full"><label class="label required" for="housingCost"><span>Current monthly rent</span></label><input data-money="true" id="housingCost" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="$3,683"/><div class="help">Every payment is an investment in someone else’s future.</div></div></div></div><div class="upgrade-reason-box" id="upgradeReasonBox"><div class="fields"><div class="field full"><label class="label required" for="upgradeReason"><span>Why are you upgrading?</span></label><select id="upgradeReason"><option value="">Choose the main reason</option><option>More space</option><option>Growing family</option><option>Better location</option><option>Better quality home</option><option>Lifestyle change</option><option>Other</option></select><div class="help">A bigger home, better location or lifestyle move — capture the reason behind your next move.</div></div></div><div class="other-reason-box" id="otherReasonBox"><div class="fields"><div class="field full"><label class="label required" for="otherReason"><span>Other reason</span></label><input id="otherReason" placeholder="Tell us what is driving the move"/></div></div></div></div></section>
</div>
<div class="actions" id="screen1ActionBar"><button class="primary" type="submit">Review My Details →</button><button class="secondary" id="resetButton" type="button">Clear</button><div class="safety"><strong>Quick. Private. Zero credit score impact.</strong>No paperwork required. Just clarity.</div></div>
<div class="confirm-panel" id="confirmPanel"><h3>Let’s confirm your roadmap.</h3><p class="confirm-intro">This isn’t just a summary—it’s the foundation for <span id="confirmNameInline">Sarah and James</span>’ future home.</p><table class="confirm-table"><thead><tr><th>Milestone</th><th>Detail</th><th>Your Current Vision</th></tr></thead><tbody id="confirmRows"></tbody></table><p class="emotional-close" id="emotionalClose">Everything look right?</p><div class="confirm-buttons"><button class="primary" id="routeButton" type="button">Show Me the Cost of Waiting →</button><button class="secondary" id="editButton" type="button">Edit details</button></div></div>
</form>
</section>
</div>
</section>
<section class="screen" id="screen2">
<div class="brand-row"><div class="brand-block"><h1>BuySooner</h1><div class="brand-line"></div><p>Buy sooner. Buy smarter.</p></div><div class="progress"><div class="progress-label">Step 2 of 5 — The Cost of Waiting</div><div class="progress-track"><div class="progress-bar" style="width:50%"></div></div></div></div>
<div class="card"><section class="hero hero-with-image"><div class="hero-copy"><h2>The Cost of Waiting</h2><div class="hero-line"></div><h3>The great Australian dream has become a maths problem.</h3><p>Property values are growing faster than you can save.</p><div class="personal-line" id="personalLine">Sarah and James, this is what waiting could mean for your Lower North Shore target.</div></div><div class="hero-image-panel"><img alt="Keys and alarm clock representing the cost of waiting" class="hero-photo" src="p2.png"/></div></section><section class="content"><div class="waiting-tax"><div class="big-icon">▦</div><div><div class="scenario-chip" id="scenarioShown">Scenario shown: AI Area Trend 6% over 3 years</div><div class="label">The Waiting Tax is</div><div class="amount" id="waitingTax">$286,524</div><div class="subtext" id="landlordLine">Whilst you have paid $132,600 to your landlord.</div><div aria-label="Market movement visual" class="market-movement"><div class="movement-row"><div class="movement-point"><div class="movement-label">Today</div><div class="movement-value" id="moveToday">$1.00m</div></div><div class="movement-arrow">→</div><div class="movement-point"><div class="movement-label">Future</div><div class="movement-value" id="moveFuture">$1.19m</div></div></div><div class="movement-caption" id="moveCaption">The goalposts move by $191,016.</div></div></div><aside class="market-panel"><div><h4>BuySooner AI Insights</h4><p id="marketInsightText">Based on local data for your property and suburb, our AI has mapped out your growth potential. Select a market speed and payout timeline from the dropdowns to update your personalised wealth projection.</p></div><div class="market-controls"><div class="market-field"><label for="marketGrowthSelect">Market Outlook</label><select id="marketGrowthSelect"><option value="0.04">Conservative — 4% p.a.</option><option selected="" value="0.06">AI Area Trend — 6% p.a.</option><option value="0.07">Active — 7% p.a.</option><option value="custom">Select your own</option></select><div class="custom-growth" id="customGrowthWrap"><input id="customGrowthRate" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="Enter % p.a."/></div></div><div class="market-field"><label for="timelineSelect">Your Saving Timeline</label><select id="timelineSelect"><option value="2">2 Years</option><option selected="" value="3">3 Years</option><option value="4">4 Years</option><option value="5">5 Years</option></select></div></div><div class="market-note">This is a what-if scenario only. It is not a property valuation or market forecast.</div></aside></div><div class="two-cards"><div class="insight-card"><div class="number-badge">1</div><div class="insight-top"><div class="line-icon">⌂↗</div><div><h4>The Price Hike</h4><p id="priceHikeText">At 6% annual growth, the same home rises from $1.50m to $1.79m in three years.</p></div></div><div class="cost-box"><div class="cost-label">Cost:</div><div class="cost-amount" id="priceHikeCost">$286,524</div><div class="cost-text">more for the same home.</div></div></div><div class="plus-circle">+</div><div class="insight-card"><div class="number-badge">2</div><div class="insight-top"><div class="line-icon">$⌂</div><div><h4>The Rent Drain</h4><p id="rentDrainText">At $850/week, three more years of renting costs $132,600.</p></div></div><div class="cost-box"><div class="cost-label">Cost:</div><div class="cost-amount" id="rentDrainCost">$132,600</div><div class="cost-text">money paid in rent while you wait.</div></div></div></div><section class="choice"><h3>Your choice</h3><div class="choice-grid"><div class="choice-card"><div><div class="red" id="rentWaitLabel">Wait 3 years</div><div class="choice-number" id="choiceWaitGrowth">$286,524 growth</div><div class="choice-copy" id="choiceWaitCopy">Whilst you have paid $132,600 in rent.</div></div></div><div class="or-circle">OR</div><div class="choice-card"><div><div class="green">Buy now</div><div class="choice-copy">Start building your equity, not your landlord’s.</div></div></div></div></section><div class="assumptions"><div id="assumptionLine">Assumptions (Sydney example):<br/>6% property growth p.a. • Home price today $1,500,000 • Rent $850/week • 3-year waiting period</div><div class="mini-brand"><div class="home-mark"></div><span>BuySooner<br/><small>Buy sooner. Buy smarter.</small></span></div></div><div class="actions"><button class="primary" id="toBridgeFromRent" type="button">See how BuySooner bridges the gap →</button><button class="secondary" id="backFromRent" type="button">Back</button></div></section></div>
</section>
<section class="screen" id="screenCompromise">
<div class="brand-row"><div class="brand-block"><h1>BuySooner</h1><div class="brand-line"></div><p>Buy sooner. Buy smarter.</p></div><div class="progress"><div class="progress-label">Step 2 of 5 — The Cost of Compromise</div><div class="progress-track"><div class="progress-bar" style="width:50%"></div></div></div></div>
<div class="card"><section class="hero hero-with-image"><div class="hero-copy"><h2>The Cost of Compromise</h2><div class="hero-line"></div><h3>The longer you wait for the “perfect” deposit, the further your dream home moves out of reach.</h3><div class="personal-line" id="upgPersonalLine">Sarah and James, this is what waiting could mean for your Lower North Shore target.</div></div><div class="hero-image-panel"><img alt="Keys and alarm clock representing the cost of waiting" class="hero-photo" src="p2.png"/></div></section><section class="content"><div class="waiting-tax"><div class="big-icon">▦</div><div><div class="scenario-chip" id="upgScenarioShown">Scenario shown: AI Area Trend 6% over 3 years</div><div class="label">The Step-Up Cost is</div><div class="amount" id="upgWaitingTax">$286,524</div><div class="subtext" id="upgGapLine">Whilst the gap between your current home and your next home grows by $286,524.</div><div aria-label="Step-up movement visual" class="market-movement"><div class="movement-row"><div class="movement-point"><div class="movement-label">Current position</div><div class="movement-value" id="upgMoveToday">$1.00m</div></div><div class="movement-arrow">→</div><div class="movement-point"><div class="movement-label">Next home</div><div class="movement-value" id="upgMoveFuture">$1.19m</div></div></div><div class="movement-caption" id="upgMoveCaption">The step-up gap grows by $191,016.</div></div></div><aside class="market-panel"><div><h4>BuySooner AI Insights</h4><p id="upgMarketInsightText">Based on local data for your property and suburb, our AI has mapped out your growth potential. Select a market speed and payout timeline from the dropdowns to update your personalised wealth projection.</p></div><div class="market-controls"><div class="market-field"><label for="upgMarketGrowthSelect">Market Outlook</label><select id="upgMarketGrowthSelect"><option value="0.04">Conservative — 4% p.a.</option><option selected="" value="0.06">AI Area Trend — 6% p.a.</option><option value="0.07">Active — 7% p.a.</option><option value="custom">Select your own</option></select><div class="custom-growth" id="upgCustomGrowthWrap"><input id="upgCustomGrowthRate" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="Enter % p.a."/></div></div><div class="market-field"><label for="upgTimelineSelect">Your Saving Timeline</label><select id="upgTimelineSelect"><option value="2">2 Years</option><option selected="" value="3">3 Years</option><option value="4">4 Years</option><option value="5">5 Years</option></select></div></div><div class="market-note">This is a what-if scenario only. It is not a property valuation or market forecast.</div></aside></div><div class="two-cards"><div class="insight-card"><div class="number-badge">1</div><div class="insight-top"><div class="line-icon">⌂↗</div><div><h4>The Price Hike</h4><p id="upgPriceHikeText">As the market moves, the “step up” becomes more expensive every day. At 6% annual growth, the same home rises from $1.50m to $1.79m in three years.</p></div></div><div class="cost-box"><div class="cost-label">Cost:</div><div class="cost-amount" id="upgPriceHikeCost">$286,524</div><div class="cost-text">more for the same home.</div></div></div><div class="plus-circle">+</div><div class="insight-card"><div class="number-badge">2</div><div class="insight-top"><div class="line-icon">◷</div><div><h4>The Lifestyle Delay</h4><p id="upgLifestyleText">Whether it’s more space for the kids or a better location for your sanity, you can’t get those 3 years back.</p></div></div><div class="cost-box"><div class="cost-label">Cost:</div><div class="cost-amount" id="upgLifestyleYears">3 years</div><div class="cost-text" id="upgLifestyleCostText">3 more years of your family outgrowing their space.</div></div></div></div><section class="choice"><h3>Stay or Step Up?</h3><div class="choice-grid"><div class="choice-card"><div><div class="red" id="upgWaitLabel">Wait 3 years</div><div class="choice-number" id="upgChoiceWaitGrowth">$286,524 in market growth</div><div class="choice-copy" id="upgChoiceWaitCopy">Pay $286,524 more while your family lacks room.</div></div></div><div class="or-circle">OR</div><div class="choice-card"><div><div class="green">Buy now with BuySooner</div><div class="choice-copy">Lock in today’s price. Move into the home that fits your life. Start building equity sooner.</div></div></div></div></section><div class="assumptions"><div id="upgAssumptionLine">Assumptions:<br/>6% property growth p.a. • Home price today $1,500,000 • 3-year waiting period • Target: Lower North Shore • Upgrader pathway based on Growing family</div><div class="mini-brand"><div class="home-mark"></div><span>BuySooner<br/><small>Buy sooner. Buy smarter.</small></span></div></div><div class="actions"><button class="primary" id="toBridgeFromUpg" type="button">See how BuySooner bridges the gap →</button><button class="secondary" id="backFromUpg" type="button">Back</button></div></section></div>
</section>
<section class="screen" id="screenBridge">
<div class="brand-row"><div class="brand-block"><h1>BuySooner</h1><div class="brand-line"></div><p>Buy sooner. Buy smarter.</p></div><div class="progress"><div class="progress-label">Step 3 of 5 — Can BuySooner be the solution?</div><div class="progress-track"><div class="progress-bar" style="width:75%"></div></div></div></div>
<div class="card"><section class="hero hero-with-image"><div class="hero-copy"><h2>Can BuySooner be the solution?</h2><div class="hero-line"></div><h3 id="bridgeHeroSubtitle">Sarah and James, here is how BuySooner could help bridge the gap for your Lower North Shore home.</h3></div><div class="hero-image-panel"><img alt="Bridge leading to a home representing the BuySooner deposit bridge" class="hero-photo" src="p3.jpg"/></div></section><section class="content"><h3 class="section-heading"><span>The Reality Check</span></h3><div class="reality-grid"><div class="reality-card"><div class="card-label">The Target</div><div class="card-value" id="targetValue">$1,500,000</div><div class="card-copy">The price of the home you want to buy today.</div></div><div class="reality-card"><div class="card-label">The Hurdle</div><div class="card-value" id="hurdleValue">$300,000</div><div class="card-copy">The 20% deposit usually required to unlock the door.</div></div><div class="reality-card"><div class="card-label">The Missing Piece</div><div class="card-value" id="gapValue">$150,000</div><div class="card-copy">The shortfall preventing your purchase now.</div></div></div><section class="bridge"><h3>The Logic of the Solution</h3><div class="equation deposit-bridge-visual"><div class="equation-card"><strong id="yourContribution">$150,000</strong><span>Your Contribution</span></div><div class="connector-label">plus</div><div class="equation-card"><strong id="buySoonerBridge">$150,000</strong><span>BuySooner Bridge</span></div><div class="connector-label">equals</div><div class="equation-card"><strong id="totalDeposit">$300,000</strong><span>Total Deposit</span><em class="milestone-note">20% deposit milestone</em></div></div><p class="result-line" id="bridgeResultLine">The Result: BuySooner bridges the missing piece so you can move from planning to buying.</p></section><h3 class="section-heading"><span>The Transfer of Value</span></h3><div class="shift-grid"><div class="shift-card"><h4 id="shiftOneTitle">From Saving to Owning</h4><p id="shiftOneCopy">You stop “chasing” the full deposit and start building equity in your own home from Day 1.</p></div><div class="shift-card"><h4>From Waiting to Locking-In</h4><p id="lockInCopy">You secure the $1,500,000 price today. Any future growth in the Lower North Shore market works for you, not against you.</p></div><div class="shift-card"><h4 id="shiftThreeTitle">From Renting to Investing</h4><p id="rentCopy">Your $3,683 monthly rent drain ends. Your housing payments start supporting your own future, not your landlord’s.</p></div></div><div class="footer-statement"><div class="footer-icon">⌂</div><div id="bridgeFooterStatement">You bring the contribution. BuySooner provides the bridge. Together, we bridge the deposit barrier so you can own the future, sooner.</div></div><div class="actions"><button class="primary" id="toOwnership" type="button">Show the Path to Full Ownership →</button><button class="secondary" id="backFromBridge" type="button">Back</button></div></section></div>
</section>
