</section>
<p class="final-disclaimer">This roadmap is an illustrative guide only. It is designed to help you understand how BuySooner could work for you. Any application, approval, property purchase, refinance or final outcome will depend on your circumstances, the property, lender requirements and BuySooner’s assessment.</p>
